{{Term/Store|Rainbow Sparrow|Rainbow Sparrows|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Rainbow Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Rainbow Sparrow'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Rainbow Sparrow}}
Rainbow Sparrows are a brightly colored variety of [[Sparrow]], with more vivid coloring than their closer relatives.<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref><ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These small birds hail from the Faron region. As the name suggests, their feathers are more colorful than other sparrows', which has made them a favorite among dilettantes. They feed on small rain-forest insects, but the omnivore in them loves nuts as well. |Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> Typical Rainbow Sparrows have purple wings, backs and tails, pink necks and tail tips, red heads, creamy throats and green bellies. They chiefly inhabit tropical forests within [[Faron (Region)|Faron]], such as the [[Faron Grasslands]].<ref name="Compendium"/> They also live in areas of [[West Necluda]]. In addition to this, Rainbow Sparrows are omnivores, feeding on a mixture of nuts and small [[Insect]]s.<ref name="Compendium"/> They gather in small groups, but they will fly away if they are disturbed. A Rainbow Sparrow that is killed will drop a [[Chickaloo Tree Nut]].

